<section xml:id="section-1" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>My First Section</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>This article serves two purposes.  First, it serves as a focus for my efforts to learn how to author articles in PreTeXt.
      Second, it will record some theorems from geometry that either I find interesting or which may be relevant to the course
      I will teach in the Fall of 2026 at Michigan State University.
    </p>
  </introduction>
  <subsection xml:id="subsection-1">
    <title>Metric Geometry</title>
    <p>Let X be a CAT(0) space.  Then X is contractible.</p>
